    "text": "This website is the online supplementary materials of (mulder_time_noDate?). It contains the R code and Mplus syntax for the simulation study and its complete numerical results.\n\nSimulation Study\nFor the simulation study, data were generated in R and C++ using the R packages Rcpp (Eddelbuettel and François 2011) and RcppArmadillo (Eddelbuettel and Sanderson 2014). Analyses of the generated data were performed using Mplus version 8.11 (Muthén and Muthén 2017) for Scenarios 1 and 2 and using the R package lavaan (Rosseel 2012) for Scenario 3.\n    🔗 Click here to download the R and C++ code for the simulation study.\n    🔗 Click here to download the Mplus input files for the simulation study.\nThe bias and 95% confidence interval coverage rate for all estimated regression parameters across all three scenarios can be found in the tabs below.\n\nScenario 1\n\n\n\n\n\nAverage estimate and 95% Monte Carlo confidence interval (MC-CI) around the average for estimates of the lag-0 effect β and autoregressive effect φ across experimental conditions in Scenario 1. For β we additionally report the standard error SD as well as the 95% coverage rage (Coverage).\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nβ\n\n\nφ\n\n\n\nm\nEvery\nAvg.\n95% MC-CI\nSD\nCoverage\nAvg.\n95% MC-CI\n\n\n\n\n1\n1\n0.501\n[0.497 - 0.505]\n0.078\n0.965\n0.497\n[0.495 - 0.499]\n\n\n1\n2\n0.599\n[0.593 - 0.605]\n0.092\n0.792\n0.253\n[0.251 - 0.255]\n\n\n1\n3\n0.620\n[0.614 - 0.626]\n0.091\n0.750\n0.128\n[0.126 - 0.13]\n\n\n1\n5\n0.621\n[0.615 - 0.627]\n0.089\n0.745\n0.030\n[0.028 - 0.032]\n\n\n1\n10\n0.625\n[0.619 - 0.631]\n0.095\n0.741\n-0.002\n[-0.004 - 0]\n\n\n2\n1\n0.649\n[0.643 - 0.655]\n0.092\n0.584\n0.371\n[0.369 - 0.373]\n\n\n2\n2\n0.716\n[0.71 - 0.722]\n0.095\n0.363\n0.097\n[0.095 - 0.099]\n\n\n2\n3\n0.715\n[0.709 - 0.721]\n0.101\n0.401\n0.021\n[0.019 - 0.023]\n\n\n2\n5\n0.716\n[0.71 - 0.722]\n0.096\n0.388\n0.000\n[-0.002 - 0.002]\n\n\n2\n10\n0.717\n[0.711 - 0.723]\n0.099\n0.388\n-0.002\n[-0.004 -